Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Thank you, Mr. Chairman, and thank you, members of the House,

asr-000064
00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:15.719
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: members of the Committee, and former colleagues, my former colleagues.

asr-000065
00:06:16.599 --> 00:06:20.319
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And, of course, uh, present here with me is the team from the Ombudsman's Office

asr-000066
00:06:20.319 --> 00:06:21.524
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: to present our budget.

asr-000067
00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:28.000
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And this opportunity is very important for us to be able to face, uh, the members of the House

asr-000068
00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:31.480
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: which is in charge of the appropriations of the Philippine government.

asr-000069
00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:37.100
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And, uh, if there's one thing that can be said about what we do,

asr-000070
00:06:37.759 --> 00:06:39.226
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: or how we handle our job,

asr-000071
00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.360
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: at least personally on my side,

asr-000072
00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:44.880
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: I cannot wait every morning to get to the office.

asr-000073
00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.432
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: It's something that we love to do.

asr-000074
00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:51.899
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: We believe that, uh, serving the country is a most noble calling,

asr-000075
00:06:52.319 --> 00:06:57.755
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: and that, uh, the people deserve the best service from all of us.

asr-000076
00:06:58.479 --> 00:07:05.230
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: And, uh, to be able to help me present the budget will be Assistant Ombudsman Luigi Bonoan.

asr-000077
00:07:05.759 --> 00:07:06.698
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Thank you. Good morning.

