00:59:02.960 --> 00:59:05.039
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: of the Committee on Appropriations,

asr-001007
00:59:05.039 --> 00:59:07.079
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: I believe that providing adequate

asr-001008
00:59:07.079 --> 00:59:08.920
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: resources to the ombudsman is

asr-001009
00:59:08.920 --> 00:59:11.200
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: an investment in strengthening

asr-001010
00:59:11.200 --> 00:59:13.039
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: our institutions

asr-001011
00:59:13.039 --> 00:59:15.710
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: and restoring public trust.

asr-001012
00:59:15.720 --> 00:59:17.160
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: We fully support a budget

asr-001013
00:59:17.160 --> 00:59:19.039
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: that will enable the office to

asr-001014
00:59:19.039 --> 00:59:21.599
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: continue upholding integrity

asr-001015
00:59:21.599 --> 00:59:23.359
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: and ensuring accountability

asr-001016
00:59:23.359 --> 00:59:24.760
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: in public service.

asr-001017
00:59:24.760 --> 00:59:26.883
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Thank you so much, Mr. Chair. [unclear]

asr-001018
00:59:27.440 --> 00:59:28.165
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Your Honor.

asr-001019
00:59:28.680 --> 00:59:29.630
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much.

asr-001020
00:59:29.640 --> 00:59:31.029
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: That is

asr-001021
00:59:31.039 --> 00:59:32.468
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: an expression of support.

asr-001022
00:59:33.520 --> 00:59:35.236
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Let us give a hand to

asr-001023
00:59:36.280 --> 00:59:38.932
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: to Ma. Isabel Sagarbarria.

asr-001024
00:59:40.799 --> 00:59:41.390
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-001025
00:59:41.400 --> 00:59:42.273
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So next,

asr-001026
00:59:42.640 --> 00:59:44.270
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: we will go to the next

asr-001027
00:59:44.280 --> 00:59:45.462
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: interpellator.

asr-001028
00:59:46.440 --> 00:59:48.470
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And we certainly would like

asr-001029
00:59:48.480 --> 00:59:50.963
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: to have from the minority

asr-001030
00:59:52.280 --> 00:59:53.510
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: our assistant,

asr-001031
00:59:53.520 --> 00:59:54.029
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: our Deputy

asr-001032
00:59:54.039 --> 00:59:58.557
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: our Deputy Minority Leader, Antonio Tinio. The floor is yours.

asr-001033
01:00:02.359 --> 01:00:03.687
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001034
01:00:04.599 --> 01:00:12.327
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mr. Chair, napakahalaga po ng Office of the Ombudsman, lalo pa at of course,

asr-001035
01:00:14.280 --> 01:00:24.123
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: you know, hinaharap pa rin ng bansa ang isa sa mga pinakamalaking corruption scandal sa kasaysayan.

asr-001036
01:00:24.760 --> 01:00:26.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of course, ang tinutukoy ko yung flood control.

asr-001037
01:00:27.599 --> 01:00:37.589
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At ngayon, ang Office of the Ombudsman na lang ang tanging opisina na nagtutuloy pa ng investigasyon at pagkaso sa mga sangkot.

asr-001038
01:00:39.079 --> 01:00:42.483
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung House, matagal nang hindi nag-investigate.

asr-001039
01:00:43.039 --> 01:00:45.757
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung Blue Ribbon Committee, tumigil na.

asr-001040
01:00:46.280 --> 01:00:47.933
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung ICI is defunct.

asr-001041
01:00:48.359 --> 01:00:49.756
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, Ombudsman na lang talaga.

asr-001042
01:00:50.760 --> 01:00:56.829
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, at kayo ang inaasahan ngayon na mag-deliver doon sa panawagan na lahat ng

asr-001043
01:00:56.839 --> 01:00:58.042
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: lahat ng sangkot dapat managot.

asr-001044
01:00:58.640 --> 01:01:05.950
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At esensyal dun sa slogan na yun, popular slogan na yun, yung kailangan maging fair.

asr-001045
01:01:05.960 --> 01:01:10.681
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig sabihin, patas walang kinikilingan, lahat ng sangkot dapat managot.

asr-001046
01:01:17.480 --> 01:01:21.177
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, ang tanong po natin ay,

asr-001047
01:01:23.760 --> 01:01:31.150
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kumusta po ang investigasyon, particular kaugnay sa involvement ng mga...

asr-001048
01:01:31.160 --> 01:01:34.711
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: officials ng Malacañang mismo, no,

asr-001049
01:01:36.119 --> 01:01:40.069
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaugnay na na-involve sa flood control.

asr-001050
01:01:40.079 --> 01:01:41.866
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Or at least na merong mga...

asr-001051
01:01:44.559 --> 01:01:48.312
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: statement at testimonya na nagsasabing involved sila.

asr-001052
01:01:49.079 --> 01:01:53.932
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, I am talking about the public statements made by Zaldy Co, for one.

asr-001053
01:01:56.960 --> 01:02:00.789
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And also, Usec. Bernardo.

asr-001054
01:02:00.799 --> 01:02:08.697
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of DPWH, as relayed by Sen. Ping Lacson in the official records of the Senate.

asr-001055
01:02:09.559 --> 01:02:15.818
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, of course, yung video testimony ni Zaldy Co, malamang napanood ng marami yan.

asr-001056
01:02:16.440 --> 01:02:18.704
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Binanggit niya na...

asr-001057
01:02:20.960 --> 01:02:22.315
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ilang opisyal ang binanggit niya.

asr-001058
01:02:23.000 --> 01:02:27.563
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: DBM Secretary Pangandaman, Executive Secretary Bersamin,

asr-001059
01:02:31.720 --> 01:02:32.963
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Undersecretary Adrian Bersamin.

asr-001060
01:02:34.520 --> 01:02:35.731
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Usec. Jojo Cadiz.

asr-001061
01:02:36.440 --> 01:02:49.771
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Among others, na inutos daw ng Presidente na maglagay ng 100-billion-peso insertion sa 2025 budget.

asr-001062
01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:57.162
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, si Usec. Bernardo naman, as relayed by Sen. Ping Lacson,

asr-001063
01:02:58.920 --> 01:03:02.427
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and this is in the records of the Senate,

asr-001064
01:03:03.400 --> 01:03:04.047
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sabi niya,

asr-001065
01:03:06.640 --> 01:03:11.029
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Usec. Bernardo corroborated yung sinabi ni Zaldy Co.

asr-001066
01:03:11.039 --> 01:03:16.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi niya, sa 100 billion na yan, 51 billion, ako ang trumabaho.

asr-001067
01:03:17.720 --> 01:03:21.293
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At, allegedly, sabi rin ni Yusek Bernardo,

asr-001068
01:03:23.680 --> 01:03:26.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nakipagsabwatan siya with Usec. Trygve Olaivar

asr-001069
01:03:28.920 --> 01:03:36.093
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of DepEd, to deliver a total of 8 billion in kickbacks to the President,

asr-001070
01:03:36.799 --> 01:03:42.944
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including 2 billion delivered through an exchange of armored cars at Diamond Hotel

asr-001071
01:03:44.319 --> 01:03:47.029
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in March of 2025.

asr-001072
01:03:47.039 --> 01:03:47.770
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Very detailed.

asr-001073
01:03:48.640 --> 01:03:49.070
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-001074
01:03:49.880 --> 01:03:54.352
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang tanong po ay, bakit hanggang ngayon,

asr-001075
01:03:55.200 --> 01:03:59.349
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay wala pang anumang imbestigasyon na isinasagawa

asr-001076
01:03:59.359 --> 01:04:00.950
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa lahat ng mga opisyal

asr-001077
01:04:02.200 --> 01:04:06.755
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng dating opisyal ng kabinete na binanggit?

asr-001078
01:04:07.839 --> 01:04:11.630
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun po ang importanteng tanong natin dito.

asr-001079
01:04:11.640 --> 01:04:17.269
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bakit hanggang ngayon, ay wala pang tayong naririnig na anumang investigasyon?

asr-001080
01:04:17.279 --> 01:04:20.086
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Let me mention that on March 30,

asr-001081
01:04:20.880 --> 01:04:25.638
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meron pong private individuals led by David Michael San Juan,

asr-001082
01:04:28.039 --> 01:04:29.190
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: former Representative Franz Castro,

asr-001083
01:04:29.200 --> 01:04:30.869
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: among others,

asr-001084
01:04:31.359 --> 01:04:37.383
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: who filed a

asr-001085
01:04:37.580 --> 01:04:41.390
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: letter or a complaint to the Ombudsman para imbestigahan ang mga ito.

asr-001086
01:04:41.400 --> 01:04:42.614
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: To the Ombudsman, please.

asr-001087
01:04:44.599 --> 01:04:45.430
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Ombudsman Remulla, to respond.

asr-001088
01:04:45.440 --> 01:04:48.858
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Wala ho siguro naririnig sapagkat hindi ho namin

asr-001089
01:04:49.599 --> 01:04:55.230
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: trabahong ipabalita yung aming pinakukulo pa.

asr-001090
01:04:55.240 --> 01:04:59.675
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasi nga, hindi ho madaling magbuo ng kaso.

asr-001091
01:05:00.400 --> 01:05:02.746
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ang pagbubuo ng kaso ay base sa ebidensya.

asr-001092
01:05:03.440 --> 01:05:06.510
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: At hindi ho natin maaaring ipamalita sa tao

asr-001093
01:05:06.520 --> 01:05:10.323
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: ang bawat kilos na ginagawa namin.

asr-001094
01:05:10.839 --> 01:05:13.529
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Yun lang po, humihingi lang kami ng kaunting pangunawa

asr-001095
01:05:14.160 --> 01:05:17.910
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: sapagkat kung ilantad po namin lahat ng aming ginagawa,

asr-001096
01:05:17.920 --> 01:05:22.589
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: alam na ho ng aming mga sinusundan ang aming ginagawa.

asr-001097
01:05:22.599 --> 01:05:25.780
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Dapat ho kasi may panahon na tahimik po tayo sa kaso.

asr-001098
01:05:26.079 --> 01:05:27.750
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero wala ho kami pinababayaan.

asr-001099
01:05:27.760 --> 01:05:29.470
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Masasabi ko sa inyo yan.

asr-001100
01:05:29.480 --> 01:05:33.109
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Wala ho kaming pinalulusot dito.

asr-001101
01:05:33.119 --> 01:05:36.648
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ito po lahat ay base sa ebidensya, kagalang-galang.

asr-001102
01:05:37.359 --> 01:05:37.728
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-001103
01:05:38.279 --> 01:05:45.693
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, naiintindihan ko po ang sinasabi nyo na hindi nyo binubulgar sa publiko

asr-001104
01:05:46.039 --> 01:05:56.003
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang inyong ginagawa at maaaring may mga isinasagawa kayong investigasyon.

asr-001105
01:05:56.359 --> 01:05:59.345
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Binubuo pa ho namin yung mga ganyang kaso po kasi.

asr-001107
01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:01.572
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kailangang mabuo nang maayos yan.

asr-001108
01:06:02.039 --> 01:06:07.613
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Mula ho sa kwento ni Bernardo at sa kwento na lumalabas sa media,

asr-001109
01:06:08.359 --> 01:06:12.440
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: para ho malagyan natin ng ebidensya, mas mabigat pong trabaho 'yon.

asr-001110
01:06:12.799 --> 01:06:14.853
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kaya yung ebidensya po ang hinahanap namin.

asr-001111
01:06:15.359 --> 01:06:19.696
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero yan po, tinitingnan na ho namin ang budget, tinitingnan na namin yung mga numero.

asr-001112
01:06:20.240 --> 01:06:26.007
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: At kung nagkataon po na mayroon talagang pagkatama sa mga halagang binibigay,

asr-001113
01:06:26.440 --> 01:06:30.175
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: yun po'y aming sinusundan. Sinusundan po namin 'yan. Okay? Sinusubaybayan.

asr-001114
01:06:32.680 --> 01:06:39.269
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At may assurance kayo na kahit involved dito ang secretaries ng kabinete,

asr-001115
01:06:39.279 --> 01:06:44.150
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng Malacanang, at kahit ang Pangulo mismo, kahit tumuro dito sa Pangulo,

asr-001116
01:06:44.160 --> 01:06:48.518
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay kasama yan sa iimbestigahan nyo. Tama po ba?

asr-001117
01:06:49.680 --> 01:06:53.328
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Opo. Lahat po 'yan ay base sa ebidensya. Wala ho tayong sasantuhin dito.

asr-001118
01:06:54.480 --> 01:06:59.349
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, thank you. At pangalawang tanong na lang, Mr. Chair, to wind up.

asr-001119
01:06:59.359 --> 01:07:00.269
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Please proceed.

asr-001120
01:07:00.279 --> 01:07:01.242
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, thank you po.

asr-001121
01:07:02.119 --> 01:07:05.910
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaugnay naman po sa ano naman po ang ginagawa.

asr-001122
01:07:05.920 --> 01:07:11.510
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang flood control corruption ay hindi naman po nagsimula sa kasalukuyang administrasyon.

asr-001123
01:07:11.520 --> 01:07:16.936
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kumbaga, talagang pambihira ang naging paglaki at paglaganap nito.

asr-001124
01:07:17.640 --> 01:07:22.630
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero as early as 2018, natatandaan ko, sa Kongreso din mismo na ito,

asr-001125
01:07:22.640 --> 01:07:27.972
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay unang nilantad yung modus ng mga insertion at, ah,

asr-001126
01:07:28.680 --> 01:07:30.824
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ghost projects and so on.

asr-001127
01:07:34.000 --> 01:07:41.658
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron po bang ginagawa ang ombudsman sa pag-imbestiga sa mga flood control corruption issues

asr-001128
01:07:42.400 --> 01:07:46.028
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa panahon pa ng nakaraang administrasyon?

asr-001129
01:07:48.839 --> 01:07:52.897
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Opo, at hindi lang po madali talaga sapagkat sabihin natin,

asr-001130
01:07:53.799 --> 01:07:59.900
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: ang epicenter po ng flood control bago dumating ang Marcos administration ay Davao City.

asr-001131
01:08:00.240 --> 01:08:00.710
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Okay.

asr-001132
01:08:00.720 --> 01:08:02.583
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ang ecosystem of corruption po mabigat.

asr-001133
01:08:03.200 --> 01:08:04.473
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Mahirap pong pasukin.

asr-001134
01:08:05.119 --> 01:08:07.780
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Mahirap pong kumuha ng impormasyon.

asr-001135
01:08:08.480 --> 01:08:10.244
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Marami hong taong hindi nagsasalita.

asr-001136
01:08:10.680 --> 01:08:12.083
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero hindi ho kami tumitigil.

asr-001137
01:08:13.039 --> 01:08:16.505
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Davao po yung ecosystem na aming tinutukoy.

asr-001138
01:08:17.359 --> 01:08:22.070
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: At napaka, kasi doon ho maraming pondo na pumasok daw sa flood control.

asr-001139
01:08:22.080 --> 01:08:24.419
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Yan po yung aming kinakalap nang husto.

asr-001140
01:08:25.159 --> 01:08:29.043
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: At meron pa hong mga lalawigan na aming tinitingnan sa panahong iyon.

asr-001142
01:08:30.679 --> 01:08:31.110
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: upang, ah, makita

asr-001143
01:08:31.120 --> 01:08:35.827
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: yung pattern kung saan po nagsisimula yung mga pattern, Your Honor.

asr-001144
01:08:36.040 --> 01:08:36.430
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-001145
01:08:36.440 --> 01:08:40.889
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, okay, malinaw po ang sinabi, no?

asr-001146
01:08:41.279 --> 01:08:43.707
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Epicenter of corruption.

asr-001147
01:08:44.920 --> 01:08:45.550
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Flood control, Your Honor.

asr-001149
01:08:45.560 --> 01:08:52.482
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Flood control corruption ang Davao City noong panahon ng nakaraang administrasyon.

asr-001150
01:08:53.199 --> 01:08:55.870
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Opo, but I will not draw that conclusion immediately.

asr-001151
01:08:55.880 --> 01:08:57.427
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ito po yung pinag-aaralan namin.

asr-001152
01:08:57.839 --> 01:09:00.590
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasi ang mahalaga po,

asr-001153
01:09:00.600 --> 01:09:03.316
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: makita namin ang ebidensya sa, sa ground, Your Honor.

asr-001154
01:09:03.560 --> 01:09:04.070
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-001155
01:09:04.080 --> 01:09:05.430
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In that regard, meron pong...

asr-001156
01:09:05.440 --> 01:09:06.430
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Please wind up.

asr-001157
01:09:06.440 --> 01:09:09.590
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Your time is up, but you can list for the second round.

asr-001158
01:09:09.600 --> 01:09:10.032
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes, opo.

asr-001159
01:09:10.520 --> 01:09:11.618
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: There are only those who have listed in the second round.

asr-001160
01:09:12.480 --> 01:09:13.749
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: To wind up po.

asr-001161
01:09:13.759 --> 01:09:14.082
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Yes.

asr-001162
01:09:14.520 --> 01:09:23.178
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Um, paalala ko lang po sa Ombudsman na meron po tayong finile din na, um, information,

asr-001163
01:09:23.640 --> 01:09:29.709
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sinubmit na information sa Ombudsman regarding precisely mga flood control anomalies.

asr-001164
01:09:29.719 --> 01:09:30.755
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May mga question, no?

asr-001165
01:09:31.359 --> 01:09:32.763
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala pa pong conclusion doon.

asr-001166
01:09:34.040 --> 01:09:36.458
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, batay sa pagsusuri natin sa mga numero.

asr-001167
01:09:36.880 --> 01:09:44.470
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa budget, pagkumpara ng budget, appropriations, at saka yung mga kontrata at yung mga actual projects delivered.

asr-001168
01:09:44.480 --> 01:09:48.473
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No. So, sana po makatulong din sa inyong investigasyon.

asr-001169
01:09:49.880 --> 01:09:50.954
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hanggang doon na lamang po.

asr-001170
01:09:51.000 --> 01:09:52.186
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Salamat po. Salamat po.

asr-001171
01:09:52.320 --> 01:09:52.743
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Okay. Thank you po.

asr-001172
01:09:53.239 --> 01:09:55.470
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Representative Tinio.

asr-001173
01:09:55.480 --> 01:09:56.371
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Ombudsman Remulla.

asr-001174
01:09:57.000 --> 01:10:01.520
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The next in the list will come from the majority.

asr-001175
01:10:01.520 --> 01:10:04.440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We have Representative Salvador Pleyto.

asr-001176
01:10:04.440 --> 01:10:05.382
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The floor is yours.

asr-001177
01:10:06.199 --> 01:10:07.627
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001178
01:10:08.800 --> 01:10:12.993
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Sa ating mga dear colleagues and esteemed guests.

asr-001179
01:10:14.120 --> 01:10:20.030
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Pangunguna ni Ombudsman Boying Remulla at saka Ombudsman family.

asr-001180
01:10:20.640 --> 01:10:24.198
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Magandang umaga po—hapon na po—sa inyong lahat.

asr-001181
01:10:25.080 --> 01:10:29.040
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Mr. Chair, may I respectfully manifest that...

asr-001182
01:10:29.040 --> 01:10:35.892
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: this representation fully supports the approval of the proposed 2027 budget of the Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001183
01:10:36.159 --> 01:10:42.642
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Siguro po, dagdagan natin ang Budget for Personnel Services para sa karagdagan number of personnel.

asr-001184
01:10:43.239 --> 01:10:59.080
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Mr. Chair, it appears that the total number of authorized positions for the Office of the Ombudsman is only 2,439 for the year 2025, 2026, and 2027, which remains the same.

asr-001186
01:10:59.080 --> 01:11:17.560
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Considering the enormous line-up of programs, activities, and projects under your operations, sa dami ng kanilang ginagawa po, siguro po, dapat lamang po nadagdagan po natin ang number ng authorized personnel positions, corresponding budget for personal services.

asr-001187
01:11:17.560 --> 01:11:21.520
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001188
01:11:21.520 --> 01:11:27.790
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, we get the response. Aside from the proposal for personnel services, what else would you need, Ombudsman Remulla?

asr-001189
01:11:27.800 --> 01:11:29.840
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Actually, ano ho eh, ah,

asr-001190
01:11:29.840 --> 01:11:37.120
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Hindi pa ho namin napupuno iyong, iyong ano, iyong number na iyong plantilya na approved po ng DBM.

asr-001191
01:11:37.120 --> 01:11:40.068
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasi marami hong proseso bago tayo makahire ng tao.

asr-001192
01:11:40.480 --> 01:11:42.616
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Marami hong patakaran na kailangan sundin.

asr-001193
01:11:43.920 --> 01:11:52.600
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Yung mga tao na sinimulan naming i-recruit nung December, marami ho diyan ngayon, itong linggo lang namin na-hire.

asr-001194
01:11:52.600 --> 01:11:54.639
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasi dadaan po sa civil service, marami hong pinagdadaanan na proseso.

asr-001195
01:11:54.639 --> 01:11:57.920
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero iyon nga, sabi ko nga,

asr-001196
01:11:57.920 --> 01:12:03.719
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: It took us more than ten and a half months to hire 60 lawyers.

asr-001197
01:12:03.719 --> 01:12:06.000
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Hindi ho madali, kaya lang ginagawa ho namin unti-unti.

asr-001198
01:12:06.000 --> 01:12:15.679
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kung, kung, ah, luluwag po iyong standard, na luluwag po iyong proseso, mas mabilis naming mapupunan iyan.

asr-001199
01:12:15.679 --> 01:12:20.639
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ngunit, hindi naman kami nagre-reklamo. Alam namin na kasama po ito sa buhay natin sa gobyerno.

asr-001200
01:12:20.639 --> 01:12:27.976
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasi yung personnel board, marami hong nagmi-meeting muna bago po aprobahan yung mga taong nag-a-apply.

asr-001201
01:12:31.000 --> 01:12:33.545
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much, Ombudsman Remulla.

asr-001202
01:12:34.000 --> 01:12:39.440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Now, I would just like to acknowledge additional members who are now present in this briefing.

asr-001203
01:12:40.600 --> 01:12:44.547
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We have the Honorable Niko Daza.

asr-001204
01:12:46.280 --> 01:12:50.082
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Vice Chair. Vice Chair Niko, please be recognized. Where are you?

asr-001205
01:12:51.400 --> 01:12:52.073
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: There, Nico.

asr-001206
01:12:53.000 --> 01:12:58.402
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then, we have Representative Julius, to my right, Julius Cesar Vergara.

asr-001207
01:12:59.080 --> 01:13:01.945
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, we proceed with the next interpellator.

asr-001208
01:13:01.960 --> 01:13:09.725
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And we have now from the, okay, from the majority, Representative Girlie Veloso.

asr-001209
01:13:12.560 --> 01:13:13.505
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001210
01:13:14.520 --> 01:13:16.238
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: Maayong udto

asr-001211
01:13:17.480 --> 01:13:18.027
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: sa tanan.

asr-001212
01:13:20.120 --> 01:13:21.655
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: Another bisaya here.

asr-001213
01:13:21.760 --> 01:13:24.360
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: No further questions, Mr. Chair.

asr-001214
01:13:24.360 --> 01:13:27.639
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: Um, Malasakit at Bayanihan Party-list

asr-001215
01:13:27.639 --> 01:13:33.320
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: would just like to manifest our support to the proposed fiscal year

asr-001216
01:13:33.320 --> 01:13:36.050
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: 2027 budget of the Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001217
01:13:36.639 --> 01:13:42.120
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: At a time when public confidence in our institutions remains critical,

asr-001218
01:13:42.120 --> 01:13:44.437
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: we need an ombudsman that is independent,

asr-001219
01:13:45.179 --> 01:13:55.270
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: adequately supported, and capable of delivering accountability in a timely and credible manner.

asr-001220
01:13:55.280 --> 01:14:03.040
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: Mahalaga po na maramdaman ng ating mga kababayan na may institusyong tunay na nagbabantay

asr-001221
01:14:03.040 --> 01:14:03.880
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: sa pananagutan

asr-001222
01:14:03.880 --> 01:14:06.390
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: sa pamahalaan.

asr-001223
01:14:06.400 --> 01:14:12.199
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: At ang hustisya at accountability ay hindi lamang ipinapangako,

asr-001224
01:14:12.199 --> 01:14:16.120
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: kundi naipapakita sa maayos at napapanahong pagkilos.

asr-001225
01:14:17.440 --> 01:14:21.880
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: We therefore support the resources necessary for the office

asr-001226
01:14:21.880 --> 01:14:26.440
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: to perform its constitutional mandate effectively

asr-001227
01:14:26.440 --> 01:14:30.910
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: and to continue strengthening public trust in our institutions.

asr-001228
01:14:31.320 --> 01:14:32.520
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: Maayong udto again.

asr-001229
01:14:32.520 --> 01:14:34.550
Rep. Girlie E. Veloso: Daghang salamat.

asr-001230
01:14:34.560 --> 01:14:42.679
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Daghang salamat, Congresswoman Girlie Veloso, for your expression of support to the budget of the Ombudsman.

asr-001231
01:14:43.050 --> 01:14:46.150
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Now, we are now going to the second round.

asr-001232
01:14:48.300 --> 01:14:54.280
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Are there any more who wish to interpellate before we go to the second round?

asr-001233
01:14:56.580 --> 01:14:59.200
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Hearing none, so we go to the second round.

asr-001234
01:14:59.900 --> 01:15:03.960
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The Honorable Ombudsman, we have Representative Chel Diokno.

asr-001235
01:15:06.180 --> 01:15:07.900
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you, Chair Rufus.

asr-001236
01:15:08.780 --> 01:15:11.920
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Balik po tayo sa tanungan, Ombudsman Remulla.

asr-001237
01:15:12.500 --> 01:15:16.440
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: I came across a report recently of the performance...

asr-001238
01:15:16.440 --> 01:15:20.320
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I will suspend the proceedings to recognize and to take her proper seat.

asr-001239
01:15:20.660 --> 01:15:23.760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The chairperson of the Committee on Appropriation is present,

asr-001240
01:15:23.760 --> 01:15:25.540
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: the Honorable Mika Suansing.

asr-001241
01:15:25.720 --> 01:15:26.380
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Palakpakan natin.

asr-001242
01:15:26.380 --> 01:15:30.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Please proceed.

asr-001243
01:15:31.020 --> 01:15:32.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Now, Congressman Diokno.

asr-001244
01:15:32.840 --> 01:15:34.960
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you, and good morning, Chair Mika.

asr-001245
01:15:35.140 --> 01:15:37.560
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Baka po meron kayong gusto sabihin muna?

asr-001246
01:15:38.340 --> 01:15:39.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, thank you.

asr-001247
01:15:40.380 --> 01:15:43.640
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Based on a report I came across, in 2025,

asr-001248
01:15:44.560 --> 01:15:51.880
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: your office completed, um, 1,129 out of 2,051 fact-finding investigations.

asr-001249
01:15:51.880 --> 01:15:55.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: It's roughly 55%.

asr-001250
01:15:55.340 --> 01:15:58.380
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: And of that, 317 resulted

asr-001251
01:15:58.580 --> 01:16:01.980
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: in the filing of criminal or admin cases.

asr-001252
01:16:02.620 --> 01:16:05.060
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: May I know how we can help you?

asr-001253
01:16:05.260 --> 01:16:06.520
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Saan po ba ang problema?

asr-001254
01:16:06.720 --> 01:16:12.540
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: How can we make this process easier for the Ombudsman?

asr-001255
01:16:12.700 --> 01:16:17.140
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Para mas marami naman ang makompletuhin ninyong mga fact-finding.

asr-001256
01:16:18.180 --> 01:16:18.680
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Yes, sir.

asr-001257
01:16:19.140 --> 01:16:21.720
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Actually, yung cooperation po ng agencies.

asr-001258
01:16:22.220 --> 01:16:27.260
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero ngayon po, talagang iniisyuhan na namin ng subpoena.

asr-001259
01:16:27.760 --> 01:16:28.280
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ang probably,

asr-001260
01:16:28.580 --> 01:16:33.840
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Isang batas na kinakailangan namin yung contempt powers na ibibigay po sa Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001261
01:16:34.540 --> 01:16:39.840
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasi parang wala hong ngipin kung hindi ho tayo bibigyan ng contempt powers.

asr-001262
01:16:40.620 --> 01:16:45.760
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasi marami pa ring matitigas ang ulo pagdating po sa cooperation po sa Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001263
01:16:47.300 --> 01:16:49.880
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: How about the personnel, Ombudsman Remulian?

asr-001264
01:16:49.880 --> 01:16:55.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Do you have issues with respect to the fact-finding personnel, investigators?

asr-001265
01:16:56.420 --> 01:16:58.560
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kailangan po ba niya ng dagdag ng tao?

asr-001266
01:16:58.580 --> 01:17:02.280
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Nagha-hire pa ho kami ng marami.

asr-001267
01:17:04.540 --> 01:17:11.300
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero yung training po, tsaka equipment namin sa digital forensics, yun po yung kinakailangan palakasin namin.

asr-001268
01:17:11.820 --> 01:17:13.760
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Although may programa na ho kami para dyan.

asr-001269
01:17:14.720 --> 01:17:18.880
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: I hope that is also part of your proposal for this coming, for this budget cycle.

asr-001270
01:17:18.940 --> 01:17:20.320
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasama po, kasama po sa proposal namin.

asr-001271
01:17:20.340 --> 01:17:21.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Susuportahan po natin yan.

asr-001272
01:17:21.660 --> 01:17:22.180
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Salamat po.

asr-001273
01:17:22.620 --> 01:17:27.380
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Doon po sa issue ng forfeiture cases, may I have the data?

asr-001274
01:17:27.540 --> 01:17:28.540
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: How many have been fired?

asr-001275
01:17:28.540 --> 01:17:34.840
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Fired this year, this is 2026, last year, 2025, and 2024?

asr-001276
01:17:46.270 --> 01:17:52.750
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Sa forfeiture cases po, pinakamarami pong na-file dito noong 2022.

asr-001277
01:17:53.630 --> 01:17:55.170
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Sixty-four forfeiture cases.

asr-001278
01:17:56.050 --> 01:18:00.170
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Sa 2025 po, 12 pa lang ho ang na-file.

asr-001279
01:18:00.870 --> 01:18:02.530
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Labingwalo po sa 2024.

asr-001280
01:18:03.370 --> 01:18:05.930
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: At 32 po sa 2023.

asr-001281
01:18:05.930 --> 01:18:07.930
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: At itong 2026.

asr-001282
01:18:09.070 --> 01:18:11.770
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: At 2026, 10 pa lang po yung aming na-file.

asr-001283
01:18:12.190 --> 01:18:16.010
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero marami ho kaming susunod dito na filing sa forfeiture po.

asr-001284
01:18:16.350 --> 01:18:17.890
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Sana po, dumami pa po yan.

asr-001285
01:18:18.050 --> 01:18:23.650
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Could we request, Mr. Chair or Madam Chair, the data from the Office of the Ombudsman,

asr-001286
01:18:23.810 --> 01:18:27.030
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: especially with respect to flood control projects?

asr-001287
01:18:27.590 --> 01:18:30.290
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Ilan po ba doon, unless you have the data available now,

asr-001288
01:18:30.830 --> 01:18:35.090
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ilan po ba out of the 10 that were filed this year and the 12 last year,

asr-001289
01:18:35.090 --> 01:18:38.230
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: how many of those were related to flood control?

asr-001290
01:18:41.920 --> 01:18:44.840
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Sa forfeiture pa ho ito, o sa flood control lang?

asr-001291
01:18:44.900 --> 01:18:45.500
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Ah, flood control.

asr-001292
01:18:45.620 --> 01:18:49.180
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Wala pa ho akong... hindi pa ho kumpleto ang data namin, pero ibibigay namin sa inyo po.

asr-001293
01:18:49.440 --> 01:18:55.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Yes, I think the committee would be well apprised kung malaman po natin yan.

asr-001294
01:18:56.280 --> 01:18:58.720
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: One final question, if I may, Mr. Chair.

asr-001295
01:18:58.720 --> 01:18:59.440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Please proceed.

asr-001296
01:18:59.900 --> 01:19:01.780
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: With respect to lifestyle checks,

asr-001297
01:19:02.100 --> 01:19:07.320
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: kasama po ba ang pagtingin ninyo o pag-monitor ng social media accounts

asr-001298
01:19:07.320 --> 01:19:10.840
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ng government official at yung kanyang pamilya?

asr-001299
01:19:10.960 --> 01:19:11.740
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Kasi doon, minsan...

asr-001300
01:19:11.740 --> 01:19:13.780
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasama na po yan. Kasama po ang social media.

asr-001301
01:19:14.480 --> 01:19:17.560
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you. I'm very happy to hear that.

asr-001302
01:19:21.020 --> 01:19:23.000
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Finally, just one last question.

asr-001303
01:19:23.560 --> 01:19:28.620
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: With respect, if I recall po, yung statement of assets, liabilities, and net worth,

asr-001304
01:19:28.620 --> 01:19:30.700
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: at the bandang dulo ng form,

asr-001305
01:19:31.260 --> 01:19:36.200
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: meron siyang waiver that is executed by every official in favor of the Office of the Ombudsman

asr-001306
01:19:36.200 --> 01:19:41.660
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: that allows you to look into records of the BIR and other government agencies.

asr-001307
01:19:42.320 --> 01:19:43.420
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Could you give the committee

asr-001308
01:19:43.440 --> 01:19:49.960
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: an idea of how often and how much of your work involves

asr-001309
01:19:49.960 --> 01:19:54.900
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: using those waivers to conduct your investigations?

asr-001310
01:20:00.500 --> 01:20:05.160
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Dahil po sa waiver na yan, dapat po ang BIR mag-cooperate sa amin.

asr-001311
01:20:05.760 --> 01:20:09.800
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero siyempre, yung kooperasyon ng BIR medyo mabagal po.

asr-001312
01:20:10.400 --> 01:20:12.820
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Isa po yan sa problema namin, sa sakit ng ulo namin.

asr-001313
01:20:13.620 --> 01:20:15.020
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: We will take note of that.

asr-001314
01:20:15.020 --> 01:20:17.020
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Perhaps there is something we can do to help you.

asr-001315
01:20:17.880 --> 01:20:20.820
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: May tanong ko na rin po.

asr-001316
01:20:21.280 --> 01:20:31.920
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: I have been calling publicly that the Supreme Court impose a strict deadline for corruption cases.

asr-001317
01:20:32.560 --> 01:20:38.520
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Para sa akin kasi unconscionable na aabot hanggang sampu o dalawampu o tatlumpung taon

asr-001318
01:20:38.520 --> 01:20:40.800
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: bago matapos ang isang corruption case.

asr-001319
01:20:41.440 --> 01:20:45.940
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: When the Sandigan Bayan appeared as part of the judiciary in the last budget cycle,

asr-001320
01:20:45.940 --> 01:20:47.280
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: ang sabi po nila,

asr-001321
01:20:47.880 --> 01:20:53.700
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: meron pa silang cases na nagmula pa nung 1987 na hanggang ngayon ay nandun pa rin.

asr-001322
01:20:54.220 --> 01:20:58.660
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Now, may I hear from the Office of the Ombudsman, from Ombudsman Remulio,

asr-001323
01:20:58.900 --> 01:21:06.760
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: what do you think is the best solution to ensuring that corruption cases are given top priority by the justice system

asr-001324
01:21:06.760 --> 01:21:12.740
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: na hindi na dapat lalampas sa limang taon yung buong paglilitis ng corruption case?

asr-001325
01:21:13.160 --> 01:21:17.080
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ang una po kasi, ang ginagawa po namin ngayon kasi,

asr-001326
01:21:17.080 --> 01:21:18.480
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: nagke-case build-up po kami.

asr-001327
01:21:19.380 --> 01:21:24.000
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Tinaas po namin yung antas ng standard namin mula po sa probable cause

asr-001328
01:21:24.000 --> 01:21:26.780
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: papuntang reasonable certainty of conviction.

asr-001329
01:21:27.660 --> 01:21:32.260
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ang teorya po diyan, pagka nakalap namin ng ebidensya, ito na, i-fight po namin sa korte.

asr-001330
01:21:32.940 --> 01:21:38.740
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ready na po kaming ilatag lahat ng aming ebidensya so we can rest our case immediately.

asr-001331
01:21:40.000 --> 01:21:46.040
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kaya siguro, masanay po tayo ang ating judicial system sa continuous trial.

asr-001332
01:21:46.360 --> 01:21:46.719
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kasi,

asr-001333
01:21:47.080 --> 01:21:48.480
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: yan po lang ang solusyon dyan eh.

asr-001334
01:21:49.100 --> 01:21:51.300
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Para wala na hong inordinate delay of justice.

asr-001335
01:21:52.000 --> 01:21:54.480
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Para wala na ho tayong 40-year wait.

asr-001336
01:21:55.460 --> 01:22:00.500
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Mas maganda ho kung maging mandatory yung continuous trial pagdating sa graft cases.

asr-001337
01:22:01.220 --> 01:22:06.220
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Para ho, mailatag lahat ng ebidensya at ma-rest namin ang case namin as early as possible.

asr-001338
01:22:06.220 --> 01:22:13.360
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ang problema kasi dyan, meron hong mga kaso na alam ko ha, may mga pending pa ngayon.

asr-001339
01:22:13.880 --> 01:22:16.820
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Nag-represent kami ng evidence pero 15 years old lang yung kaso.

asr-001340
01:22:17.080 --> 01:22:21.120
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Meron pa ho kaming pending cases na hinihintay yung resulta hanggang sa ngayon.

asr-001341
01:22:21.820 --> 01:22:31.340
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Kaya, ang pagkahinog po ng kaso, marahil, pero ito pa'y paulit-ulit ko na pong kinausap ang ilang membro ng Supreme Court

asr-001342
01:22:31.340 --> 01:22:37.000
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: na bigyan po ng atensyon yung mga kaso sa Sandigan Bayan.

asr-001343
01:22:37.220 --> 01:22:38.380
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Dapat ho mapansin talaga.

asr-001344
01:22:39.100 --> 01:22:41.640
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Sapagkat hindi ho ito pwede maging laruan ng abogado.

asr-001345
01:22:42.460 --> 01:22:46.060
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Ayun ang nangyayari kasi, yung pinakamagagaling na abogado po,

asr-001346
01:22:46.060 --> 01:22:49.140
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: punta sa Sandiganbayan, basta sila yung maraming paraan.

asr-001347
01:22:49.820 --> 01:22:54.040
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Pero dapat ho dito talaga, matapos at matapos lahat ng paglatag na ebidensya

asr-001348
01:22:54.040 --> 01:22:57.580
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: para wala na hong nakakalikot na record ng gobyerno.

asr-001349
01:22:58.900 --> 01:23:01.340
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Maraming maraming salamat po, Ombudsman Remulla.

asr-001350
01:23:01.440 --> 01:23:06.640
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Ipapaabot din po namin sa judiciary ang inyong mga hinaing at saloobin.

asr-001351
01:23:06.740 --> 01:23:07.100
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you.

asr-001352
01:23:07.400 --> 01:23:07.994
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: And thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001353
01:23:08.264 --> 01:23:10.550
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Congressman Chel Diokno.

asr-001354
01:23:10.560 --> 01:23:11.909
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Ombudsman Remulla.

asr-001355
01:23:13.760 --> 01:23:14.795
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Before we proceed, I'd like to acknowledge,

asr-001356
01:23:15.280 --> 01:23:17.714
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Representative Carlos Andes Loria.

asr-001357
01:23:18.880 --> 01:23:19.823
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you for coming.

asr-001358
01:23:21.360 --> 01:23:27.383
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Now it is my honor as Vice Chairman to now yield the floor and the gavel

asr-001359
01:23:27.719 --> 01:23:31.990
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: to the Honorable, no less than the Chairperson herself,

asr-001360
01:23:32.600 --> 01:23:35.888
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: of the Committee on Appropriations.

asr-001361
01:23:36.600 --> 01:23:39.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We have here Chair Mika Suansing.

asr-001362
01:23:47.040 --> 01:23:47.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you.

asr-001363
01:23:47.600 --> 01:23:52.950
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you so much, Vice Chair Rufus Rodriguez.

asr-001364
01:23:52.960 --> 01:23:59.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ombudsman, I left you in very safe hands with Representative Rufus Rodriguez,

asr-001365
01:23:59.360 --> 01:24:05.159
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of course, one of our legal luminaries here in Congress to defend the budget of the Ombudsman.

asr-001366
01:24:05.159 --> 01:24:08.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, alam ko po, kayang-kaya po yan ni Chair Rufus.

asr-001367
01:24:08.880 --> 01:24:13.030
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I just have a few questions from a budgetary standpoint.

asr-001368
01:24:14.199 --> 01:24:20.199
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As you know, we're always in support of the Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001369
01:24:20.199 --> 01:24:20.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Last year,

asr-001372
01:24:20.720 --> 01:24:24.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we helped to work out the rental situation with the building.

asr-001373
01:24:24.520 --> 01:24:28.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And then, with all the satellite offices,

asr-001374
01:24:28.760 --> 01:24:33.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we also supplied the necessary equipment and the additional manpower

asr-001375
01:24:33.280 --> 01:24:39.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: to be able to augment the resources needed to facilitate those.

asr-001376
01:24:39.320 --> 01:24:45.719
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, this year, Ombudsman, I wanted to ask the same question to the Office of the Ombudsman.

asr-001377
01:24:45.719 --> 01:24:50.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I saw on your slides the list of requested additional funding.

asr-001378
01:24:50.920 --> 01:24:56.760
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, may we request, Ombudsman, if we may request it in writing,

asr-001379
01:24:56.760 --> 01:25:02.119
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because we would have to submit it for the deliberation of the Budget Amendments Review Subcommittee,

asr-001380
01:25:02.119 --> 01:25:07.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: which is one of our main reforms since last year, the Committee on Appropriations,

asr-001381
01:25:07.520 --> 01:25:13.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: wherein we make sure all the institutional amendments requested to the Committee on Appropriations

asr-001382
01:25:13.000 --> 01:25:19.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: are deliberated on openly to be shown to the public.

asr-001383
01:25:19.000 --> 01:25:27.239
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I saw here po additional confidential funds, Ombudsman marshal positions, motor vehicles, and the purchase of the new office building.

asr-001384
01:25:27.239 --> 01:25:33.320
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We wanted to make sure, given the very important mandate that the Office of the Ombudsman has,

asr-001385
01:25:33.320 --> 01:25:41.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: we want to make sure that we give you the resources to be able to perform all of the very important work that you are doing.

asr-001386
01:25:41.400 --> 01:25:50.247
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, may we request, Ombudsman, when you submit the letter, is it okay if we request for a prioritization?

asr-001387
01:25:51.119 --> 01:26:00.470
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We would also know if we're able to find the additional fiscal space, which ones we would prioritize first.

asr-001388
01:26:00.480 --> 01:26:06.030
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Thank you, Madam Chair. We will comply, Your Honor. We will comply as soon as possible.

asr-001389
01:26:06.040 --> 01:26:12.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, and then with regard to the requested special provision, we're always in support of that.

asr-001390
01:26:12.080 --> 01:26:18.310
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It was there in the 2026 GAAA as well, in terms of the requested special provision.

asr-001391
01:26:18.320 --> 01:26:20.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, um,

asr-001392
01:26:20.080 --> 01:26:27.239
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: We'll coordinate na lang po as we fine-tune the GAB for 2027,

asr-001393
01:26:27.239 --> 01:26:33.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that the proper wording, the necessary wording is reflected as such in the GAB.

asr-001394
01:26:33.000 --> 01:26:37.199
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, yun lang naman po. I don't have questions naman po, Chair Rufus.

asr-001395
01:26:37.199 --> 01:26:44.639
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It's really more of I wanted to make sure to give the assurance to the Office of the Ombudsman, to Ombudsman Boying,

asr-001396
01:26:44.639 --> 01:26:49.920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: that we are very much in support of the budget of the...

asr-001397
01:26:49.920 --> 01:27:02.520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Office of the Ombudsman, and we are very much appreciative, and we commend the hard work and all the good work that the Office of the Ombudsman is doing for our country.

asr-001398
01:27:02.520 --> 01:27:13.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, to show our appreciation, the best that we could do is to be able to make sure to give you the resources that you need to perform your mandate better.

asr-001399
01:27:13.800 --> 01:27:21.119
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, we'll coordinate na lang po, Ombudsman, with regard to the list of requested amendments,

asr-001400
01:27:21.119 --> 01:27:29.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: so that, if possible po, as soon as possible, given that we are, um, convening the BAR C in a week or so,

asr-001401
01:27:29.280 --> 01:27:31.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po maipasok po natin sa deliberations.

asr-001402
01:27:31.880 --> 01:27:32.830
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much po.

asr-001403
01:27:33.404 --> 01:27:34.298
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001404
01:27:35.159 --> 01:27:39.590
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Madam Chair, and thank you for that.

asr-001405
01:27:39.600 --> 01:27:42.314
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Atty. Diokno would like to be recognized.

asr-001405-split-2
01:27:42.800 --> 01:27:43.300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-001406
01:27:45.639 --> 01:27:51.709
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: May isa lang pong pahabol, if I may, Madam Chair, to the office—to Ombudsman Remulla.

asr-001408
01:27:51.719 --> 01:28:07.559
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Um, I understand that part of the function of the Office of the Ombudsman is also to monitor impeachment proceedings, uh, in case there are any investigations or prosecutions that should come after kapag may lumitaw na mga ebidensya.

asr-001409
01:28:07.880 --> 01:28:18.325
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: I also would like to say that earlier I saw your budget proposal for confidential funds, which is only at the amount of 55 million or more or less in that area.

asr-001410
01:28:18.760 --> 01:28:29.830
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: And sa palagay ko, kayo yung nangangailangan ng mas malalaking confidential funds kaysa sa yung mga ibang mga ahensya na tinututukan natin doon sa kaso ng impeachment.

asr-001411
01:28:29.840 --> 01:28:48.835
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: My question is, uh, may I know if the—your office is presently monitoring the, uh, status of the testimonies and evidence being presented, especially with respect to the confidential funds, for possible, um, violations that may be investigated after?

asr-001412
01:28:50.320 --> 01:28:53.870
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: It is being monitored by our office, Your Honor.

asr-001413
01:28:53.880 --> 01:28:58.420
Ombudsman Jesus Crispin C. Remulla: There is—there is an active unit monitoring the goings-on at the impeachment, Your Honor.

asr-001414
01:28:58.960 --> 01:29:04.030
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Thank you so much for that, because we do have some concerns about, um, accountability.

asr-001415
01:29:04.040 --> 01:29:07.070
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: That's precisely why we have the impeachment process.

asr-001416
01:29:07.080 --> 01:29:09.541
Rep. Jose Manuel Tadeo "Chel" I. Diokno: Maraming salamat po, Chair. Maraming salamat, Ombudsman.

asr-001418
01:29:09.880 --> 01:29:14.270
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much. May I now reassume as Vice Chair?

asr-001419
01:29:14.280 --> 01:29:22.270
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Because there are no more interpellators, and so therefore this Chair, this Vice Chair, now is ready to accept a motion.

asr-001420
01:29:22.280 --> 01:29:22.754
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: to terminate.

asr-001421
01:29:26.480 --> 01:29:32.080
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Uh, Mr. Chair, may I move that we terminate the budget briefing of the Office of the Ombudsman?

asr-001422
01:29:32.080 --> 01:29:32.693
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: I so move.

asr-001423
01:29:33.239 --> 01:29:35.910
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Is there any second motion?

asr-001424
01:29:35.920 --> 01:29:36.190
Committee member: Second.

asr-001425
01:29:36.199 --> 01:29:37.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Moved and seconded.

asr-001426
01:29:37.920 --> 01:29:39.190
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We now terminate.

asr-001427
01:29:40.287 --> 01:29:46.719
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Congratulations, Ombudsman Remulla, and we thank you for coming and presenting your budget.

asr-001428
01:29:47.480 --> 01:29:52.159
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And so we thank also our members for your active participation.

asr-001429
01:29:52.159 --> 01:29:54.867
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The briefing is now terminated.

asr-001430
01:29:57.280 --> 01:29:57.685
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-001431
01:29:58.159 --> 01:30:04.639
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The committee proceedings—just an announcement—the committee proceedings are hereby suspended and will resume at 3 p.m.

asr-001432
01:30:05.480 --> 01:30:07.253
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: for the Commission on Audit

asr-001433
01:30:07.800 --> 01:30:10.072
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: budget briefing. Thank you.

